WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.200
Every fragrance has three layers.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.600
The top notes give the first impression and fade within minutes.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.600
The heart notes are the character of the fragrance for hours.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.500
The base notes stay the longest, sometimes until the next day.
